WEBVTT

00:10:29.746 --> 00:10:31.996
počevši od 25 okomito, piše,

00:10:32.329 --> 00:10:33.954
Oh, usput,

00:10:34.162 --> 00:10:37.162
ovca može ostati prazna.”

00:10:38.246 --> 00:10:39.287
(Smijeh)

00:10:39.662 --> 00:10:40.787
(Pljesak)

00:10:43.246 --> 00:10:45.371
Ali, čekajte, ima još nešto,
još jedna stvar.

00:10:45.412 --> 00:10:48.162
Ima još jedan konačni djelić slagalice.

00:10:48.746 --> 00:10:52.496
Gwen, jako sam zahvalan na Vašem izboru

00:10:52.871 --> 00:10:54.621
jer ako pogledamo

00:10:54.829 --> 00:10:56.871
prva slova Vaših kombinacija

00:10:57.079 --> 00:10:59.871
dobivamo “C-H-A-O-S” za kaos

00:10:59.871 --> 00:11:02.704
i “O-R-D-E-R” za red.